{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 84899, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 59597, "uid": 90022, "type": 4, "title": "萌新基础入门", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1628085233, "updated_at": 1631460957, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1678345687, "last_at": 1678345687, "comment_count": 13, "status": 1, "summary": "天命之子韩服（wiki群930267486）仅仅为萌新入坑建议，对于后续玩法不作讨论，有任何问题欢迎指出。本人韩服咸鱼，对于以下说法有任何见解欢迎指正。1.入坑准备，突然看到这款游戏想玩，要如何下载和", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086663451_57012072.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086347602_53094355.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086279422_94404917.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 24, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 85815, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 23, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 84899, "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;\">天命之子韩服（wiki群<span style=\"\">930267486</span>）<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">仅仅为萌新入坑建议，对于后续玩法不作讨论，有任何问题欢迎指出。本人韩服咸鱼，对于以下说法有任何见解欢迎指正。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">1.<span style=\"\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">入坑准备，突然看到这款游戏想玩，要如何下载和各种设备端口可能遇到的问题。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;text-indent:-54.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">（1）<span style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">第一步下载游戏，要去哪里下载？各大游戏加速器或者平台都可以下载最新的游戏包。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;text-indent:-54.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">（2）<span style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">游戏账号获取和登入游戏，刚开始是可以拿邮箱挂个加速器进入游戏的，现在需要苹果<span style=\"\">id</span>或者一个谷歌账号进行绑定才能进入游戏。此游戏登入时需要加速器或者魔法进入游戏后可以关闭。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;text-indent:-54.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">（3）<span style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">关于除了手机外的设备问题，模拟器，这里推荐雷电或者逍遥（都需要<span style=\"\">64</span>位）不然可能出现游戏无法进入并且闪退的情况，对于云手机市面上有挺多的仁者见仁智者见智了，本人是用不习惯那个基本用的模拟器。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;text-indent:-54.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">（4）<span style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">特殊情况无法进入游戏，游戏维护更新，一般为周四，都会有时间公示自己注意一下就好，还有各种提示网络啥的，自己检查加速器和网络配置问题。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">2.<span style=\"\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">进入游戏了，常用的功能界面介绍 <span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">首先必须明确一点，能玩下去才是基础，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:21.3333px;\">游戏汉化可以通过醉游购买下载使用，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:21.3333px;\">uu</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:21.3333px;\">加速器有自带的机翻。</span></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628085710089_92322576.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628085710089_92322576.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628085804934_88171804.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628085804934_88171804.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">周期副本，主线探索，日常副本<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">周期副本周期性开放，<span style=\"\">RD</span>和<span style=\"\">WB</span>均在这个位置<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">这就是主界面的基本内容<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">这个游戏刚开始玩要干什么和注意事项<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">（<span style=\"\">1</span>）结束新手教程后调整阵容<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><br></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628085932043_83822817.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628085932043_83822817.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628085993145_95367290.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628085993145_95367290.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086092558_64362316.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086092558_64362316.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086125193_62398198.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086125193_62398198.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">根据自己的图鉴来决定前期使用的阵容，维基其他板块有详细推荐说明。一般是刀，抗性卡，奶卡，控制卡组成。天子技能维基有详细说明不作更多阐述。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">到这里很多人就感觉，啊啊啊，好麻烦啊，于是就想去买个初始号啥的。某宝的那些初始号很多可能是科技号，就是开科技把图推完直接拿到石头，买那种账号肯定是不划算的，你自己推图结束也能获得那么多石头。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">那继续往下说<span style=\"\">.</span>感觉升级好慢啊，想快速升级，可以使用经验史莱姆一般<span style=\"\">1-4</span>星前期可以直接拿来升级使用<span style=\"\">5</span>星还是推荐拆解为玛瑙点好感用。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086188706_72799408.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086188706_72799408.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086234009_58644701.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086234009_58644701.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086279422_94404917.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086279422_94404917.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086347602_53094355.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086347602_53094355.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086390940_34597082.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086390940_34597082.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">Rd</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">期间的史莱姆<span style=\"\">boss</span>（关于<span style=\"\">rd</span>下面再说明）<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">拆解装备也有金币<span style=\"\">.<o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">血石此游戏较少的资源<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">可以通过<span style=\"\">rd wb </span>每日任务\n氪金获取<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">一般用途是返魂<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">紫色玛瑙通过分解天子和任务获得。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">关于各个关卡打法阵容维基都有具体说明这里不作阐述。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">关于周期活动<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;text-indent:-54.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">（1）<span style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">Wb </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">世界<span style=\"\">boss </span>大锅饭活动打死一车发一车的奖励不打也会发放，每天把票清完就行，没必要在<span style=\"\">wb</span>投入过多的资源。\n<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;text-indent:-54.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">（2）<span style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">翻牌，就一个活动关不停刷去抽取活动奖池的奖励，前期各种资源还是有必要刷一刷的，不过基本翻牌都是可能池池吃<span style=\"\">#</span>的有可能导致亏损最大化，所以基本是把上面七个主要奖励打完就清下每日任务奖励<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;text-indent:-54.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><span style=\"\">（3）<span style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">Rd </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">最主要的胎五获得途径，刚玩碰上<span style=\"\">rd</span>可以蹭一些五星天子开局<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">对于<span style=\"\">rd</span>的各种适合人群的说明<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">刚玩对于很多属性的<span style=\"\">rd</span>你不可能很快的去达成斩车，可以通过蹭车（打<span style=\"\">1%</span>往上获得奖励，低于<span style=\"\">1%</span>没用奖励）前两天尽量把车升到<span style=\"\">30</span>级（打不过车咋办）可以去游戏交流群请佬帮你升车，或者等待第三天的杀手池（打一下就可以丢进去有人会帮你打），蹭车一般是打好友的车不过个人建议是最好蹭杀手池就行不然灵车容易被删，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; text-indent: 0cm;\">对于灵车标准的划分，你去打好友的车，在车上没有能斩车的人的条件下你第一个上去，打完车上依旧没有能斩的人一般就构成灵车。一般要认准</span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; text-indent: 0cm;\">能斩的人再上车。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; text-indent: 0cm;\">发车，多加点斩佬好友，不停刷车就行。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; text-indent: 0cm;\">Rd</span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; text-indent: 0cm;\">获得的货币可以换商店的物品，又能力最好买到刷新的最后一池，上面一排道具每日不更新（除了最后一池的每日五个箱子）下排道具每日刷新。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;\"></p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086543396_26536364.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086543396_26536364.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086603021_98809088.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086603021_98809088.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">点火界面，天子达到<span style=\"\">6</span>星满级可以点火<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">只有第一个主石头影响下面的全部属性<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;左右两边都只需要一个点火石中间需要一个与点火天相</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">同属性的天子和一个点火石。、<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086663451_57012072.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086663451_57012072.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 16pt;\">常见问题讨论和误区</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">达比问题<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">达比作为三星矿刀确实是用了很久的标配卡，不过游戏在更新，又有很多的新卡出现，达比作为三星面板的极限是远不如五星的，所以萌新在决定使用哪个矿刀前可以根据自己的图鉴来，修女，复活刀都是非常不错的选择，有的不需要点火和暴击就可以畅爽挖煤，达比点满的成本对于萌新也是一笔不小的支出，有的时候资源投入了却带来不了良好的收入，就有点得不偿失了。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">点火问题<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">部分卡点火后的提升极大，不过现在手上又没有好的点火石怎么办？点火石有很多虽然不是最佳的属性，但是又完全凑活用不必拘泥于极品石头。点火石的替换旧石头会直接消失。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">附魔问题<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">武器装备的附魔对于属性的提升是巨大的，平时也没必要硬刷附魔，可以等待三倍几率。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">发带问题<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">有很多萌新经常问发带要不要抽，这个就因人而异了，如果想长期玩下去还是不建议抽的，欧皇随意，那玩意可能花十几万石头才能抽全出现四缺一急死人的情况，非常容易上头，萌新也容易抽光石头受挫，而且有时候发带池的天子容易是两三个没啥用的，花上万石头为了两个自选还是不值得的<span style=\"\">.<o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">自选问题<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">关于天子自选箱子的使用，你可以为玩的下去先选择自己喜欢的卡毕竟玩这游戏本意就是看卡的，当然你也可以直接为了强度，对于强度天子<span style=\"\">wiki</span>都有介绍，这里不作赘述。<span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628087045148_6904611.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628087045148_6904611.jpg\"></div><p></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\">本文章纯萌新入坑建议（最基础的说明），如有问题欢迎指出，对于更多问题后续会继续补充，欢迎加入<span style=\"\">wiki</span>交流群<span style=\"\">930267486</span>，有问题欢迎来群内提问。</span></p></div></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p></p>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086663451_57012072.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086347602_53094355.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628086279422_94404917.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 90022, "username": "灵车车队の墨鱼", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/17.png", "description": "灵车是门艺术", "follow_num": 19, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 2, "content_at": 114503459, "content_num": 13, "read_num": 178249, "like_num": 93}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "